From 22a466941e81711c768c22cb0cbb4b29c2a70f9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andy Sun <bins@codeaurora.org>
Date: Fri, 13 Apr 2018 14:56:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] camera: changes for early digital case

Disable actuator and ADV bridge devices in DTS;
Make FPD-Link camera related modules load earlier;
Add boot marker in isp driver;

Change-Id: Iaa604547c83e01595b2c57ce1b92dfb1aa89b6a8
Signed-off-by: Andy Sun <bins@codeaurora.org>
---
